  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participation Colombian government delegation in OEEC25 conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supported the participation of two Colombian government officials and a Colombian offshore wind expert in the OEEC25 conference and the government masterclass programme. The programme included masterclasses, site visits, and thematic breakout sessions on offshore wind development in Colombia, as well as engagement with investors and international stakeholders. A Colombian government representative also contributed to a World Bank finance session.The participation facilitated bilateral discussions, strengthened institutional knowledge on offshore wind policy development, and enhanced understanding of approaches to advancing the offshore wind sector in Colombia. The activity covered travel and accommodation costs for the participating officials, as well as travel support for the founder of the Offshore Wind Colombia network.</narrative>
  </description>
